## RelationType: 由…分类

来源 IRI：`https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizedBy`。来源定义：relation between a lower-order classifier by a higher-order classifier such that the latter classifier categorizes the former。此 BKN 投影使用 `categorized_by_target_id` 保存目标实体 ID。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| categorized_by_target_id | entity_id |
